<div class=\"short-line\">\n        <span class=\"number\">4.</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer rose mark\">予人</span>\n        <span class=\"fixed-text\">玫瑰，手有</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer rose mark\">余香</span><span class=\"fixed-text\">。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"short-line\">\n        <span class=\"number\">5.</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer help-one mark\">平时肯帮人</span>\n        <span class=\"fixed-text\">，</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer help-two mark\">急时有人帮</span><span class=\"fixed-text\">。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"short-line\">\n        <span class=\"number\">6.</span>\n        <span class=\"fixed-text\">与其</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer brocade mark\">锦上添花</span>\n        <span class=\"fixed-text\">，不如</span>\n        <span class=\"short-answer charcoal mark\">雪中送炭</span><span class=\"fixed-text\">。</span>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"question\">\n      <span class=\"line-one\">7. 在古代，一天被分为 12 个时辰，每个时辰对应一个生肖，下面的</span>\n      <span class=\"line-two\">表格你会填吗？试一试吧！</span>\n    </section>\n\n    <table aria-label=\"十二时辰生肖表\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">子鼠</span>\n            <span class=\"time\">(23:00-1:00)</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"table-mark\">\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">丑牛</span>\n            <span class=\"time\">(1:00-3:00)</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">寅虎</span>\n            <span class=\"time\">(3:00-5:00)</span>\n          </td>\n          <td>\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">卯兔</span>\n            <span class=\"time\">(5:00-7:00)</span>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"slash-mark\">\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">辰龙</span>\n            <span class=\"time\">(7:00-9:00)</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"circle-mark\">\n            <span class=\"zodiac\">巳蛇</s